/* ============================================================================
 * PERIHELION — planet photo maps (js/planets-textures.js)
 * 
 * Equirectangular 2048x1024 JPEG data-URLs (q0.72). Imagery: Solar System
 * Scope texture set (mosaics of NASA/JPL/USGS public-domain data), fetched
 * via _build/fetch-textures.mjs, re-encoded + embedded by _qa/embed-textures.mjs.
 * saturnRings: the SST 2k_saturn_ring_alpha strip (2048x125, CC-BY-4.0 SST,
 * NASA/JPL-derived) embedded VERBATIM as PNG — its alpha carries the ring
 * structure (Cassini division etc), so it must not be re-encoded to JPEG.
 * Embedded (not fetched) because file:// pages cannot upload loose-file
 * images to WebGL (opaque-origin SecurityError).
 * ==========================================================================*/
